\ Slow integration oracle for the canonical Foundation-Day cutlet.
\ The full original date tuple for calculation and target at Foundation is
\ (year 5000, cutlet 10, day-in-cutlet 503, month 20, day-in-month 56).
\ Only the year and cutlet fields are currently available to compare.
\ This test performs real gate scans and the entire year structure sauce.
\ It is excluded from the default short check runner.

To check the complete Foundation cutlet:
  Find the year for -15055671 and -15055671.
  If the year selection success is not 1,
    put "The Foundation year was not found before cutlet selection." into the check report; exit.
  If the current year number is not 5000,
    put "The Foundation cutlet is not in year 5000." into the check report; exit.
  Choose the cutlet structure for the selected year.
  If the cutlet partition's valid selection is not 1,
    put "The Foundation cutlet partition could not be chosen." into the check report; exit.
  Resolve the cutlet of the target day.
  If the requested cutlet number is not 10,
    put "Foundation should lie in cutlet 10." into the check report; exit.
  If the requested day in cutlet is not 503,
    put "Foundation should be day 503 of cutlet 10." into the check report; exit.
